<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14530" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dĭūturnĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		diuturnus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>length of time</i>, <i>long
			duration</i>, <i>durability</i> (good prose).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With <i>gen.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">temporis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 2, 2, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Fin. 2, 27, 87</span></i> (opp. brevitas): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imperii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. de Imp. Pomp. 9, 26</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pacis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					de Or. 1, 4, 14</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C. 1, 85, 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">otii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 36, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">belli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					B. G. 1, 40, 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sall. J. 64 <i>fin.</i></span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pugnae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 3, 4, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oppugnationis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. B.
					C. 3, 9, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">memoriae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Or. 1, 28, 129</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rei publicae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rep. 2, 14 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			 et saep.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>, <i><span class="en">Cic. de Sen. 11 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. N. D. 2, 2, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Fin.
				1, 12, 40</span></i> (with longinquitas); <i><span class="en">id. Off.
				2, 7, 23 al.</span></i></div>
